&blur=200&s=3a6aa847553a9e2cb0cad0e3b52e8a59", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7b513f79/uploads/origins/2e22d253-0dab-498f-a154-c02149aceb39?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3a6aa847553a9e2cb0cad0e3b52e8a59, https://si.imgix.net/7b513f79/uploads/origins/2e22d253-0dab-498f-a154-c02149aceb39?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=12035b4745ae99f726f1b0e7a2622b49 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7b513f79/uploads/origins/2e22d253-0dab-498f-a154-c02149aceb39?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2a84182483c056e4d6e0b673199078eb 3x"}, "body": "ENG\nNice to meet you, my name is Shii☆.\n\nI saw the illustration of Belzebute that was delivered and was attracted by how cool it was!\n\nCharacter\nShinra-Bansho Chocolate Chapter 3, Part 3: Raijin King Ryuga\n\nIf possible, I would appreciate it if you could draw it in an atmosphere as if it were in battle. (It is an image of a sword clad in blue lightning that cuts through the enemy! second URL destination, bottom right image.) If you cannot accept the request, we would be very grateful if you would cancel it...!\n\nThank you in advance if you accept our request.\n\nThank you in advance if you accept our request.\nI'm Shii☆ and I was attracted by the coolness of the illustration of Belzebute when I saw the one you delivered! I would like to make a request!\n\nCharacter\nShinra-Mannjo Chocolate Chapter 3 Part 3: The Thunderbolt King Ryuga\n\nI would be very happy if you could draw him as if he were in the middle of a battle (I imagine him wearing blue lightning on his sword and cutting through his enemies! I would be very happy if you could draw it as if it were in battle (like the image on the bottom right of the second URL)! If you can't make it, I would appreciate it very much if you could cancel the offer...! If you can't make it, I would appreciate it very much...!\n\nhttps://shinrabansho.com/archive/3rd_charalist03.html\n\nhttps://x.com/miroryu/status/1651293446001553409?s=46&t=MduXDQH_9GNzlMeA3nEvqA", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@AdamRyuFord/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3005070, "client_id": 1321707, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/48ed6b51/uploads/origins/7ff577f8-21ea-4375-a982-3acef53780f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da90bae713dee61a53e4e31c3bcda14f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/48ed6b51/uploads/origins/7ff577f8-21ea-4375-a982-3acef53780f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da90bae713dee61a53e4e31c3bcda14f, https://si.imgix.net/48ed6b51/uploads/origins/7ff577f8-21ea-4375-a982-3acef53780f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e3577d70bbc88c4f34f63a46d96f227f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/48ed6b51/uploads/origins/7ff577f8-21ea-4375-a982-3acef53780f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b53dc6c0d05c4ed58cf3878a9cb7e2fd 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/48ed6b51/uploads/origins/7ff577f8-21ea-4375-a982-3acef53780f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ef46951065372f1e9dd757bd86d8753", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/48ed6b51/uploads/origins/7ff577f8-21ea-4375-a982-3acef53780f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ef46951065372f1e9dd757bd86d8753, https://si.imgix.net/48ed6b51/uploads/origins/7ff577f8-21ea-4375-a982-3acef53780f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6a55d3c253b8cf6a226fe39a04b72d90 2x, https://si.imgix.net/48ed6b51/uploads/origins/7ff577f8-21ea-4375-a982-3acef53780f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4f1ee1ebe123bb166da891bccb60a3a8 3x"}, "body": "Hello there! I liked seeing your fighting game artwork, so I wanted to make a request! \n\nWould you be willing to draw Kaguya from the Under Night In-Birth series of fighting games? She is a dual-wielding gun user who maintains a positive, doting demeanor while she fights. I've provided some references to her design in the link below:\n\nKaguya References: https://imgur.com/a/dqIc3lr\n\nWould you be willing to draw her in a pose similar to that linked below? \n\nSuggested Pose: https://imgur.com/a/eieCN0r\n\nIf you are willing to draw some amount of background, I would like to see a night-time, urban setting. Again, it is up to you if you would like to draw a background.\n\nI leave the rest of the composition up to your discretion. Thank you very much for your consideration!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@AdamRyuFord/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3005070, "client_id": 325419, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/58e534cf/uploads/origins/606b0b84-31a6-4608-8dea-9f8ae59ce617?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9b9038ee028aa6e2a3d2d6db47209da", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/58e534cf/uploads/origins/606b0b84-31a6-4608-8dea-9f8ae59ce617?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9b9038ee028aa6e2a3d2d6db47209da, https://si.imgix.net/58e534cf/uploads/origins/606b0b84-31a6-4608-8dea-9f8ae59ce617?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23f7c133c3b9c94d8445a855d675ab2f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/58e534cf/uploads/origins/606b0b84-31a6-4608-8dea-9f8ae59ce617?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03a4ab52f915a7f135e826fed951c2b7 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/58e534cf/uploads/origins/606b0b84-31a6-4608-8dea-9f8ae59ce617?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ffcec1dc66cae1447162768b77782eb1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/58e534cf/uploads/origins/606b0b84-31a6-4608-8dea-9f8ae59ce617?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ffcec1dc66cae1447162768b77782eb1, https://si.imgix.net/58e534cf/uploads/origins/606b0b84-31a6-4608-8dea-9f8ae59ce617?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cbd9878008f225bf191e904ec9325b6d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/58e534cf/uploads/origins/606b0b84-31a6-4608-8dea-9f8ae59ce617?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4874fa806d8967f43041d3e4c950ed81 3x"}, "body": "ENG\nThank you for your help. My name is Esty.\nI was attracted by an illustration of a Guilty Gear character that appeared on your timeline, and I would like to make a request.\nI would like to request a character named \"Belzébuth\" from a work called Shinra-Bansho-Chocolate.\n\nhttps://shinrabansho.com/archive/images/05charalist/card02/046.jpg\n\nHe is a character with a battle-crazed side who walks around the world in search of the strong. I would be happy if I could imagine him facing a strong enemy who can give his all, with a maniacal smile on his face.\nIf possible, I would like to see the style of \"GG Sol\" or \"GG Ram\" in your portfolio.\n\nWe appreciate your consideration.\n\n────────────────────\n\nJPN\nお世話になります。エスティーと申します。\nタイムラインに流れて参りましたギルティギアキャラクターのイラストに惹かれ、この度依頼させていただきたく思います。\n神羅万象チョコという作品より、「ベルゼビュート」というキャラクターをお願いできますでしょうか。\n\n強者を求めて世界中を辺り歩く戦闘狂的側面を持つキャラクターです。自分の全力を出せる強敵を前に、狂気的な笑顔を浮かべ対峙しているようなイメージだと嬉しいです。\nもし可能であれば、ポートフォリオを拝見させていただいた中で、「GG Sol」や「GG Ram」の様な画風にしていただければと思います。\n\nご一考のほどよろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1UhOVlTwBbV-3ALhjdhrHGDar_NzUS_8q/view?usp=drivesdk", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 30183, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "久世", "screen_name": "clavis_kz", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1855845438806712320/jYojIaK5.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 144}, {"id": 1117291, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "土油雲", "screen_name": "FSZ_R1", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1548264869870579713/ncnw12OO.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/731674140516753409/1584324533/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 0}, {"id": 1133380, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "どらいもの", "screen_name": "cjhmltfjxat13", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1953982917316947969/-wrWn29z.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1479734501840662529/1761400878/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 145}, {"id": 1360816, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "馬かのこ👼👼", "screen_name": "chutopanda", "avatar_url": 